+| 2 | `verification.k:41–73` | `856b1e357a5f433ad09956ac507d9936d2c9e9e4e9d5a8f2a9fa32315eb71e6b` / `rule-856b1e357a5f433ad09956ac507d9936d2c9e9e4e9d5a8f2a9fa32315eb71e6b` | `priority(40)` | `PROVED_DERIVED_LEMMA` |
