+| 4 | `verification.k:110–142` | `f9e5b4514f00b3ed026d33dbeec83015df4208cb8c2aeed1d460d93c10f63efe` / `rule-f9e5b4514f00b3ed026d33dbeec83015df4208cb8c2aeed1d460d93c10f63efe` | `priority(40)` | `PROVED_DERIVED_LEMMA` |
